{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b29d47f288e89277e0aa210cbf5620b0a0aa466c32fc8da45a22f686166ee8a2",
      "text": "...Hah—!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "10": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b4beca6b8f1a547d6f77857e0cb8dd9332b0b701cba3d3a80e33e3c751a13d88",
      "text": "...How was it, Soushiro?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "14": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f823c03339bb76e62d70ded7ef633cd96c874ab1358036fbca01954e736018d3",
      "text": "Splendid. A technique so fine,\nsomeone of my level has nothing to\nsay.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "17": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0eea56ff333e5d19975a5c1a089a9dea2bc2c70afeb1d318df336f6fcc055063",
      "text": "...Then there is no point in having\nyou watch me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "21": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d08911d5f5f207637a01fc6f7de1b833a380a3e603594dc7b77ebb50d167a2d8",
      "text": "You only asked me to \"watch.\" But I\nmean it sincerely. A beautiful\nsword that seeks no blood.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "24": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7b03d465ba6ce9178f1bf6614f8dec80a3265c243ff740f963db5e3c08fbf086",
      "text": "An age of peace is where such\nswords are needed, I suppose.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "28": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d520ddcd6aa4d8c6043abacdfca59c4cb204659baf957f7544c34c2621f7e913",
      "text": "Grandfather often said that because\nwe hold great power, we must train a\nheart that never turns it on others.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "30": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:33ae9f1cf7ef2dc95557c1fe87bc05894fc65f66a18454d03d9dd46ec204fe86",
      "text": "...That true strength needs mind,\ntechnique, and body together. More his\nown belief than the school's, he said.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "32": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:eef3fe1acd44431a7d642360f698b863cf983c81fc2bb0b07d4fe28e8e3cf119",
      "text": "In your eyes, does my sword hold...\nstrength of heart?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "36": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d64d2d1bd32729941f5ec188ca1ff668da74801be831395d137f3a0c967838b1",
      "text": "I see. Then, you must learn fear.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "40": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e40b2ef33e861a4b5223260a45f9cff20564834ad2b2b3a3b5d77e2934cd15e6",
      "text": "Fear...? What do you mean by that?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "43": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:08093a1f4d9654118aa06ba485eba5dec6c8d7deb41fef3894832ad2be5c82d2",
      "text": "Well, that is not for others to\nsay. Oh, we are no longer talking\nabout the sword.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "49": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:67b790ffb0a0e3afd954610bcb2ef904324c4bc9a62aa8ae24bd5ff0c7aedcba",
      "text": "That is why I would like to ask\nyour advice a little...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "52": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:42e94e74b4a369894b822f7e35d5e17c566e95353f6588f411bdf9e29acdeb4b",
      "text": "Hmm, if this is about martial arts,\nam I really the right person...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "56": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a27e1c60e5daa3f76bf5f5f276978e7096bbfa1bc2f80b5d59f712fa0b50da3d",
      "text": "Go do this somewhere else...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "60": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4d0b3c55b09cf34623818ca9999da72812e190561beeb194e7ec55c02a2cae62",
      "text": "Besides, for that kind of talk,\nwouldn't Nimbus or Ayumu be better?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "65": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d6788f0cfffadbf95255e11f287f854f950995b44930e6620deb3c77af87b605",
      "text": "...I grew up at a girls' school.\nThe only men near me were from the\ndojo and my school teachers.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "67": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:698956775091f04ad4e3d9aed43878710d370d09fb464f61e79e5b1eabd192a4",
      "text": "So work and training are fine, but\nbeing alone with a man in\nprivate... is a bit...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "73": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:09238a30f5b6233a8cd0ba2434906cdd30f3a4c0595e3984417c5d0a055bdd87",
      "text": "Ha! The gorilla who beat down\nAegis's hangout by herself is\nacting like a maiden.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "78": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:681324735d36afe4a69f9393ede6b1c17c2a9cdfbf5e98c2aaa0f87b11046161",
      "text": "Gorilla is rude! That was only\nbecause you kept pressing those\nunreasonable recruitments...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "82": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c937802f7d3deb63a26c258a03f5e18b9352516b34f361d42654680b36c1d38e",
      "text": "You did that...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "85": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9849abe9b7c522f78d72284281fceaf9f23f0cb1f73514408941c70b0b54e7f2",
      "text": "Never mind what I did! This is a\nconsultation, a consultation...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "89": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:149114dc437837e53f63d5ffe2a3c4396d57a7a041bf321efc766225602d35e4",
      "text": "Soushiro spoke of fear. Does it mean I\nknow no true terror? Or that there is\na fear in my heart I have not noticed?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "92": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:37381ad093ea3ede913efb55f12b8676a9127216427879514d5d39a3044a4cc6",
      "text": "It's cliche, but... maybe you're\nafraid of fighting?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "96": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7cba6e5728a64e372790fb7dc7e3ed5beafc3f1823cd3261956339164010ef7e",
      "text": "...Is that so? I thought I grew\nstronger to overcome that...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "100": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:29cdf907d39f7215e9d7077a8b1d0bf5ad93c4f85c57ca46bcb835bf96b10bec",
      "text": "A-ah, no! It is not that I learned\nthe sword to defeat bad people. It\nis about my state of mind...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "104": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:18b6784f604057a71f1f7ce7c4e783824f719e129c268c968021a3fa2980fc36",
      "text": "It's okay. I get it. ...Is it about\ncourage?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "108": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c9617e7cc29b458c85b3aa40de5d3f43dfc00052073e51103723915edf554f2a",
      "text": "...Let go of the cliff. I wanted\nthe courage to fight when I should.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "111": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:77f8cb35151bac684af6c79500c1a1a3f827dfe272c35794ab1ce1585f7a9015",
      "text": "In elementary school, my only\nfriend was being bullied.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "114": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b6426b2263aafd34fdc18abbbd0e35c3a12f901770d84f9043ce64675ea95319",
      "text": "...I do not think I should have\ngrabbed a shinai and beaten them\ndown. But I... I...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "117": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4e17047203dff5f30dc376a91265cac5057e1f3e8f1902ac57c57ff6fb650b2c",
      "text": "You wanted to speak up?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "122": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fd933c9f5cdeb5bf6954946deac372d50ed5a47e9e5fde9549371cb34a823f80",
      "text": "Yes. I never want to look away\nagain. That is why I became\nstrong...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "127": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d4a8c9f57c185009a17d3acf40392394012aadfb4442e861893bc227f80c2c2d",
      "text": "Pfft, what's that? Total\nself-satisfaction. Does it mean\nanything?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "131": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4",
      "text": "That is...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "134": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1baadedd3ca5db7b029cae6969d66095bd7b685ae122bbd5202bfc2ab4700ce3",
      "text": "Perhaps it does not.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "137": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d85b37217d98425ce1c4c01098ad6a4f1642a931616fddb26fcf3b2defedaae3",
      "text": "It is only that I do not want to\nhave regrets... So it is purely for\nmy own sake—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "142": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:05e990e063a30e2a301387b42f5faa1ba0b7fba11cc8186ed58236a63630c2e6",
      "text": "...But that's—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "146": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6e70f04ce995db5e619a2e5e82210fc1b17be3331abbbf74a49da4c7a62e11af",
      "text": "No... Perhaps it is not even\nself-satisfaction?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "150": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f37439803fb8a2a329fdad6c4673832a896b2a95a312d56a74e6334f171c4c22",
      "text": "All things change. No matter how\nstrong I become, I cannot save\neveryone.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "152": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:38c6fa51c7014a998728ac031cc06974062ac4128f2754701f894c43612bae95",
      "text": "...Much less will that child, who\nis no longer here, forgive me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "154": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:847157d1b23d1200a4f2a3790ee73ef0868c924f6d5e742559dee2703586363d",
      "text": "—I fight so I won't regret. Yet as\nlong as I fight, my regrets will\nonly grow.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "157": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:10ac00641149a2df95645514f37735caf09706d94131f86c5edf90baab0f0b83",
      "text": "So... Ah, yes. This is what\nSoushiro meant.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "160": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3c4b8b15ff1bcbd89a6d4f1cad7c8448b9ba8eecd5542dfa05c7947922244c58",
      "text": "...My wish will never be granted.\nNot to be free of regret, not to be\nforgiven. This road has no end.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "163": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0b295338fdb318f380d93d8f7aed0b6ddf6a68969ce4e2ad90cd690622be954c",
      "text": "My road has no meaning. That is\nwhat frightens me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "168": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6c8ac860d5db309bb23d8284c757a1816d76c50bada30e65a7e3818d1cde5832",
      "text": "Huh... I don't get it... Creepy...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "172": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:12351e10fad62326d4522badb9a9bb789c0ba7bd2e49654aa388d5ec5a3c44fe",
      "text": "S-sorry! I convinced myself all\nalone! Um, what I meant was...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "176": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f9eae7649c9a75a12f46f47f3915fead7fcf4509b55205c179aee5e89b3b707c",
      "text": "Hmm... I don't claim to understand\neither. Are you afraid it might be\nmeaningless?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "181": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1be9bea5162882afbdd6a5482373a3ddc045118019a8b7a5490d3302d1b0f538",
      "text": "Yes! That is it!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "183": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d4fc19aa25e6f011f97a32124c55efa39cab44f9b29f5b8a7bcd917f098bb0f1",
      "text": "Even a dragon-slaying art is still\nan art. If you want to do it, do\nit. That was all it was...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "186": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b173c36ecab86bd10cc662eff420a756fad59ae6c948c24bb98db55e3d0fd3c6",
      "text": "I see. Then you should do it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "189": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:064179ab907c529f0741363372a059021a257408f1891761cb817cc7f0c17b71",
      "text": "Yes! Thank you, both of you!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "195": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0e28f79fd43c380ac8a259bb44f6cea062cbf8e7e8aa43f7440861efc18780d0",
      "text": "That was a totally\ngorilla-to-gorilla conversation...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "201": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:84ff5d3a40d6d3d01f9c959be54dff30342b8236d6b3a0b1318c671acdec472b",
      "text": "Ahaha! Yeah, of course! No way Nagi\nwould ever give up!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "205": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:34c5c1168ea8fe69fa8d9a68c52297e6cc3199e8d5ed94e7916ccc754e02b2bf",
      "text": "Yae... Making me sound like a\nwillful young lady...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "209": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6c4a0c86f1c038a391e46e62f540159750e1d47c49c6573205df01685b7ab259",
      "text": "It has meaning.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "212": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:39a97503f964ff20112d2d7619b6dfde2ae0b864626960724bc973e9be4512a1",
      "text": "At least I've been saved by you\nloads of times, Nagi! Middle school\nmidterms? Pop quizzes? And also...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "216": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6a407ff14e9d2c75a4be8f44fb00f75f5361a92dead662d93f8e7d7b568dba76",
      "text": "That is because you did not do them\nproperly.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "219": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7159b02c42bb7d9388affe9534cdbda5c95ed988bcd167c8e0ff95e400cc3a01",
      "text": "Come on, just take the thank-yous\nfrom the person you helped!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "223": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bcba7df383cc5fdd3851c3958915f49ec19ed4a9cf3751cfbd322fe66b12703e",
      "text": "Take the thank-yous... I see. There\nis something to that.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "227": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:10c0183ee2d05bd8107dfc9117cedd392cc606027c40f3078858c186610a7b13",
      "text": "Right? Am I a genius or what?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "231": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:df941a09313b946450d36a0cccda2eca5324a42cfb43c95f533947dc57e6bd22",
      "text": "Heh, indeed. ...Thank you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
